# Build context for the root Dockerfile (the release image). The Dockerfile
# COPYs only pyproject.toml, README.pypi.md, LICENSE, NOTICE and src/; everything
# else stays out of the context, so it never reaches the builder at all, remote
# builders included. deploy/kind/Dockerfile has its own Dockerfile.dockerignore.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.pypi.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
src/veridor.egg-info/
**/__pycache__/
